y as written.\\n\\nContents of [workspace] (project instructions, checked into the codebase):\\n\\n# 科研工作区入口\\n\\n共享上下文：scientific-evidence 3.1.0。当前目录对应一个科研任务。\\n\\n从 [context/INDEX.md](context/INDEX.md) 定位任务契约和共享 Skill；成功读取核心后按职责加载参考模块。主 Agent \n...\n</persisted-output>", "status": "completed", "is_async": false, "tool_use_id": "call_efe11caf28194fb1a4db87e1"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:59:26.254420+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:59:27.319015+00:00"}}

