data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1971, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "a78b6c18-3bf4-4045-871a-ad00631119e5", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 1971, "revision": 1971, "parent_tool_use_id": "call_e7e057924f3a40a980c8d2d2", "agent_call_id": "b3ffe44d-6be1-4f63-8a26-cdae502c8404", "data": {"text": "The output file has been successfully written to `[workspace]`.\n\nKey findings:\n\n- **F20** (Legendre l=2 coefficient, `index_1=2`) was extracted from all 13 energy levels at both order=0 and order=1.\n- **Order 0 F20 values** range from 0.002577 (at 26.35 eV) to 0.005593 (at 34.1 eV). The sequence is non-monotonic with 7 local extrema (3 maxima, 4 minima). A degree-3 polynomial fit yields R-squared of 0.486, indicating moderate but not strong polynomial trend.\n- **Order 1 F20 values** range from 0.004463 (at 26.35 eV) to 0.009688 (at 34.1 eV). No sign changes were detected -- all values are positive across the full energy range.\n- All 13 energy coefficients (order=0 and order=1, indices 0-10) are stored in `all_order0_coeffs` and `all_order1_coeffs`."}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:00:35.270501+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:00:35.270508+00:00"}}

