data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2070, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "19fe4302-2eda-489d-93d8-7285db6b8b34", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2067, "revision": 2070, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Now I need to update Result.md. The key changes:\n1. The \"15/15 PASS\" claim in the clean-directory section needs correction — the `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` was NOT independently rebuilt from a script; it was directly computed by the main agent because both the original sub-agent code and the representative reconstruction had column-parsing bugs.\n2. The Finding 2 reference to the sub-agent results needs updating since the authoritative file was itself wrong (stale sub-agent output).\n\nLet me fix Result.md:\n\n"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:03:02.364106+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:03:03.354358+00:00"}}

