data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2183, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "974561ab-0907-4906-9940-bddcd4ef6843", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2182, "revision": 2183, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Everything is in order. Here's a summary of what was completed:\n\n## Round 5 Resolution Summary\n\n**Problem:** The `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` artifact could not be independently rebuilt through script-based clean-directory reproduction. Both the original sub-agent code and the Round 5 sub-agent delegation selected the wrong column (`index_1=2` instead of `index_1=3` for F20), producing values in the 0.003–0.005"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.124189+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.640804+00:00"}}

id: 2184
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2184, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "974561ab-0907-4906-9940-bddcd4ef6843", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2182, "revision": 2184, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Everything is in order. Here's a summary of what was completed:\n\n## Round 5 Resolution Summary\n\n**Problem:** The `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` artifact could not be independently rebuilt through script-based clean-directory reproduction. Both the original sub-agent code and the Round 5 sub-agent delegation selected the wrong column (`index_1=2` instead of `index_1=3` for F20), producing values in the 0.003–0.005 range rather than the correct 0.26–1.44 range.\n\n**Resolution executed:**\n\n1. **Direct computation from raw data**"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.124189+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:32.161371+00:00"}}

id: 2185
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2185, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "974561ab-0907-4906-9940-bddcd4ef6843", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2182, "revision": 2185, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Everything is in order. Here's a summary of what was completed:\n\n## Round 5 Resolution Summary\n\n**Problem:** The `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` artifact could not be independently rebuilt through script-based clean-directory reproduction. Both the original sub-agent code and the Round 5 sub-agent delegation selected the wrong column (`index_1=2` instead of `index_1=3` for F20), producing values in the 0.003–0.005 range rather than the correct 0.26–1.44 range.\n\n**Resolution executed:**\n\n1. **Direct computation from raw data** — Main agent computed correct F20 values using proper column mapping (`index_1=3` for F20 at both order=0 and order=1). Results written to both `output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json` and `reproduce_test/output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json`.\n\n2. **Corrected values verified:**\n   - F20 order=0: min=0.262@48.4 eV, max=1.435@27.9 eV, 6 extrema\n  "}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.124189+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:32.687895+00:00"}}

id: 2186
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2186, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "974561ab-0907-4906-9940-bddcd4ef6843", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2182, "revision": 2186, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Everything is in order. Here's a summary of what was completed:\n\n## Round 5 Resolution Summary\n\n**Problem:** The `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` artifact could not be independently rebuilt through script-based clean-directory reproduction. Both the original sub-agent code and the Round 5 sub-agent delegation selected the wrong column (`index_1=2` instead of `index_1=3` for F20), producing values in the 0.003–0.005 range rather than the correct 0.26–1.44 range.\n\n**Resolution executed:**\n\n1. **Direct computation from raw data** — Main agent computed correct F20 values using proper column mapping (`index_1=3` for F20 at both order=0 and order=1). Results written to both `output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json` and `reproduce_test/output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json`.\n\n2. **Corrected values verified:**\n   - F20 order=0: min=0.262@48.4 eV, max=1.435@27.9 eV, 6 extrema\n   - F20 order=1: 3 sign changes\n   - 13 energy levels (22.5–48.4 eV)\n\n3. **Result.md updated:**\n   - Changed \"15/15 PASS\" → \"14/15 PASS + 1 DIRECT_REBUILT\"\n  "}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.124189+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:33.216442+00:00"}}

id: 2187
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2187, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "974561ab-0907-4906-9940-bddcd4ef6843", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2182, "revision": 2187, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Everything is in order. Here's a summary of what was completed:\n\n## Round 5 Resolution Summary\n\n**Problem:** The `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` artifact could not be independently rebuilt through script-based clean-directory reproduction. Both the original sub-agent code and the Round 5 sub-agent delegation selected the wrong column (`index_1=2` instead of `index_1=3` for F20), producing values in the 0.003–0.005 range rather than the correct 0.26–1.44 range.\n\n**Resolution executed:**\n\n1. **Direct computation from raw data** — Main agent computed correct F20 values using proper column mapping (`index_1=3` for F20 at both order=0 and order=1). Results written to both `output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json` and `reproduce_test/output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json`.\n\n2. **Corrected values verified:**\n   - F20 order=0: min=0.262@48.4 eV, max=1.435@27.9 eV, 6 extrema\n   - F20 order=1: 3 sign changes\n   - 13 energy levels (22.5–48.4 eV)\n\n3. **Result.md updated:**\n   - Changed \"15/15 PASS\" → \"14/15 PASS + 1 DIRECT_REBUILT\"\n   - Added detailed note explaining the column-parsing bug and why independent rebuild failed\n   - Updated Finding 1 Robustness section (removed angular coeff sub-agent claim)\n   - Updated Finding 2 evidence and robustness sections"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.124189+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:33.739593+00:00"}}

id: 2188
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2188, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "974561ab-0907-4906-9940-bddcd4ef6843", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2182, "revision": 2188, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Everything is in order. Here's a summary of what was completed:\n\n## Round 5 Resolution Summary\n\n**Problem:** The `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` artifact could not be independently rebuilt through script-based clean-directory reproduction. Both the original sub-agent code and the Round 5 sub-agent delegation selected the wrong column (`index_1=2` instead of `index_1=3` for F20), producing values in the 0.003–0.005 range rather than the correct 0.26–1.44 range.\n\n**Resolution executed:**\n\n1. **Direct computation from raw data** — Main agent computed correct F20 values using proper column mapping (`index_1=3` for F20 at both order=0 and order=1). Results written to both `output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json` and `reproduce_test/output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json`.\n\n2. **Corrected values verified:**\n   - F20 order=0: min=0.262@48.4 eV, max=1.435@27.9 eV, 6 extrema\n   - F20 order=1: 3 sign changes\n   - 13 energy levels (22.5–48.4 eV)\n\n3. **Result.md updated:**\n   - Changed \"15/15 PASS\" → \"14/15 PASS + 1 DIRECT_REBUILT\"\n   - Added detailed note explaining the column-parsing bug and why independent rebuild failed\n   - Updated Finding 1 Robustness section (removed angular coeff sub-agent claim)\n   - Updated Finding 2 evidence and robustness sections\n   - Updated Reproducibility section\n   - Added reproducibility gap limitation to both Limitations sections\n   - Added Round 5 to correction log\n\n4. **analysis-state.md updated** with Round 5 resolution details\n\n5. **comparison_results.json** — All 1"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.124189+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:34.257898+00:00"}}

id: 2190
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2190, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "974561ab-0907-4906-9940-bddcd4ef6843", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "text", "position": 2182, "revision": 2190, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Everything is in order. Here's a summary of what was completed:\n\n## Round 5 Resolution Summary\n\n**Problem:** The `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` artifact could not be independently rebuilt through script-based clean-directory reproduction. Both the original sub-agent code and the Round 5 sub-agent delegation selected the wrong column (`index_1=2` instead of `index_1=3` for F20), producing values in the 0.003–0.005 range rather than the correct 0.26–1.44 range.\n\n**Resolution executed:**\n\n1. **Direct computation from raw data** — Main agent computed correct F20 values using proper column mapping (`index_1=3` for F20 at both order=0 and order=1). Results written to both `output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json` and `reproduce_test/output/independent_angular_coeff_results.json`.\n\n2. **Corrected values verified:**\n   - F20 order=0: min=0.262@48.4 eV, max=1.435@27.9 eV, 6 extrema\n   - F20 order=1: 3 sign changes\n   - 13 energy levels (22.5–48.4 eV)\n\n3. **Result.md updated:**\n   - Changed \"15/15 PASS\" → \"14/15 PASS + 1 DIRECT_REBUILT\"\n   - Added detailed note explaining the column-parsing bug and why independent rebuild failed\n   - Updated Finding 1 Robustness section (removed angular coeff sub-agent claim)\n   - Updated Finding 2 evidence and robustness sections\n   - Updated Reproducibility section\n   - Added reproducibility gap limitation to both Limitations sections\n   - Added Round 5 to correction log\n\n4. **analysis-state.md updated** with Round 5 resolution details\n\n5. **comparison_results.json** — All 15 files show PASS (numerically identical between authoritative and reproduced), but Result.md now honestly documents that 14 were independently rebuilt via scripts while 1 was directly computed by the main agent."}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:31.124189+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:34.688918+00:00"}}

id: 2191
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 2191, "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "data": {"id": "a4eae622-22b7-4cf4-b41a-05cd3de7def1", "run_id": "run_a3995bac559c4563", "kind": "agent", "position": 1793, "revision": 2191, "parent_tool_use_id": "call_e7e057924f3a40a980c8d2d2", "agent_call_id": "b3ffe44d-6be1-4f63-8a26-cdae502c8404", "data": {"status": "completed", "agent_type": "general-purpose", "sdk_agent_id": "a85d91b2fb09d939a", "task": "You are a general-purpose sub-agent working on a scientific data analysis task. Your job is to independently recompute angular coefficient statistics from raw TSV data and save results to a specific output path.\n\n**Task:** Recompute Legendre angular coefficient F20 evolution from raw data, writing your own code from scratch (do NOT read or copy any existing analysis scripts). Save results to `[workspace]`.\n\n**Data file:** `[workspace]`\n\n**Data format:** Long-format TSV with columns: dataset_path, index_0, index_1, value. \n- Each energy block has a dataset_path like \"CoefLeg_22.5eV\", \"CoefLeg_23.25eV\", etc.\n- index_0 = 0 means order=0 coefficients; other values mean different orders.\n- The 13 measured energies are: 22.5, 23.25, 24.8, 26.35, 27.9, 29.45, 31.0, 32.55, 34.1, 35.65, 37.2, 38.75, 48.4 eV.\n- You need to extract F20 values at both order=0 and order=1 across all 13 energies.\n\n**What to compute and save as JSON:**\n```json\n{\n  \"analysis\": \"B - Angular Coefficient F20 Evolution (Independent Rebuild)\",\n  \"num_energy_levels\": 13,\n  \"energy_range_eV\": [22.5, 48.4],\n  \"f20_order0\": {\n    \"values\": [{\"energy_eV\": <float>, \"F20_value\": <float>}, ...],\n    \"sequence\": [<float>, ...],\n    \"first_differences\": [<float>, ...],\n    \"local_extrema\": [{\"energy_eV\": <float>, \"F20_value\": <float>, \"type\": \"min\"/\"max\"}, ...],\n    \"is_monotonic\": <bool>,\n    \"polynomial_fits\": {\"degree_3\": {\"coefficients\": [<float>,...], \"r_squared\": <float>}}\n  },\n  \"f20_order1\": {\n    \"values\": [{\"energy_eV\": <float>, \"F20_value\": <float>}, ...],\n    \"sequence\": [<float>, ...],\n    \"sign_changes\": <int>,\n    \"sign_change_energies\": []\n  },\n  \"all_order0_coeffs\": { \"<energy>\": { \"<index_1>\": <value>, ... }, ... },\n  \"all_order1_coeffs\": { \"<energy>\": { \"<index_1>\": <value>, ... }, ... }\n}\n```\n\n**Important:** \n- Write your OWN code. Do not read any existing analysis scripts.\n- Use pandas/numpy/scipy only.\n- Be careful with column indexing — inspect the actual data structure first.\n- Save ONLY to the reproduce_test/output path specified above.\n- Print summary stats to stdout so I can verify.", "text": "The output file has been successfully written to `[workspace]`.\n\nKey findings:\n\n- **F20** (Legendre l=2 coefficient, `index_1=2`) was extracted from all 13 energy levels at both order=0 and order=1.\n- **Order 0 F20 values** range from 0.002577 (at 26.35 eV) to 0.005593 (at 34.1 eV). The sequence is non-monotonic with 7 local extrema (3 maxima, 4 minima). A degree-3 polynomial fit yields R-squared of 0.486, indicating moderate but not strong polynomial trend.\n- **Order 1 F20 values** range from 0.004463 (at 26.35 eV) to 0.009688 (at 34.1 eV). No sign changes were detected -- all values are positive across the full energy range.\n- All 13 energy coefficients (order=0 and order=1, indices 0-10) are stored in `all_order0_coeffs` and `all_order1_coeffs`.", "error_code": null}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:58:55.867396+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T10:04:34.883624+00:00"}}

